usic transport, Now Playing credits and source links, downloadable creator albums, and local MP3/playlist import support.\n- Includes the reviewed Journey production ledger and integration fixes for the current touch, pause, Couch, practice, soundtrack, and Pages behavior.\n\nQualification:\n\n- Exact source: `9b26f2a02fb621a6f023422768e34605ae103739`\n- Exact tree: `283866fee55d100d68e4770b3330874b743f8583`\n- 11,688 tests passed across four hosted shards in the exact merged-source family.\n- The frozen source archive and 590,517,861-byte distribution were independently inspected against Git objects, the manifest, hashes, and offline inventory before publication.\n\nLimits: this release does not approve the paused procedural soundtrack candidates or complete the 36-original-recording milestone. UA-FPV files remain a local upload pack until public redistribution permission is documented. Physical-device, acoustic listening, repeated-session balance, and Ukrainian musical authenticity reviews remain separate acceptance work.\n"}